    "Question #: 14": {
      "Title": "Exam DES-1D11 topic 1 question 30 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "A customer plans to purchase a Dell EMC Unity storage system for their file storage needs. The solution must provide a way to limit the storage capacity offered to the users. Which Unity feature will provide this functionality?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. Host I/O Limits"
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. Thin Clones"
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. File System Shrink"
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. File System Quotas"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer: D \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Unity supports the File System Quotas which will enable a storage administrator to track and/or limit usage of a file system."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Limiting usage is not the only application of quotas. The quota tracking capability can be useful for tracking and reporting usage by simply setting the quota limits to zero."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Quota limits can be designated for users, or a directory tree. Limits are stored in quota records for each user and quota tree. Limits are also stored for users within a quota tree."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The usage is determined by \u05d2\u20acFile Size\u05d2\u20ac (which is the default) or \u05d2\u20acBlocks\u05d2\u20ac."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The File Size quota policy calculates the disk usage based on logical file sizes in 1K increments."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The block quota policy calculates the disk usage in file system blocks at 8KB file system blocks."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Hard and soft limits are set on the amount of disk space allowed to be used."
          }
        ]
      },
      "Explanation": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Unity supports the File System Quotas which will enable a storage administrator to track and/or limit usage of a file system."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Limiting usage is not the only application of quotas. The quota tracking capability can be useful for tracking and reporting usage by simply setting the quota limits to zero."
